# Allow-list for the agent API image (build context: repository root). Keeps .env, virtualenvs,
# node_modules and local results out of the image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!requirements-runtime.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!agent/
!api/
!mcp-servers/
!evals/
!observability/
evals/results/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
